          <div class="cell c6">
            <h2>Build your first OpenAct app.</h2>
            <p class="soft" style="margin: 16px 0 24px; max-width: 440px">Start from the repository. Give your agent the prompt at the top of this page. Keep the person in charge of every cue marked review.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="btn btn-cue" href="https://docs.openact.ing/apps">Build an app</a>
              <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/marketgrowth/openact">Open GitHub</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cell c6">
            <ol>
              <li><span><code>git clone github.com/marketgrowth/openact</code></span></li>
              <li><span>Give your agent the prompt. Name your app and its users.</span></li>
              <li><span><code>npm run design -- check</code> and <code>npm test</code></span></li>
              <li><span>Open a pull request. A person approves it.</span></li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
